---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import arabicShot from '../assets/arabic.png';
import activationShot from '../assets/activation-off.png';
import gridShot from '../assets/grid.png';
import collectionsShot from '../assets/collections.png';
---

<section class="section" id="highlights">
  <div class="section-bar"><div class="container section-bar-inner"><span>02 / Highlights</span><span>What it does</span></div></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 data-reveal>Seven things it does</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal>
        A short list, because FontCraft is a small app with one job: show you your fonts, quickly.
        The gaps are in the comparison below.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="highlights">
      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>Every font, one list</h3>
          <p>
            System fonts, fonts installed for your user, fonts FontBase turned on, and folders you
            add, grouped by family. Search by name or by where a font is stored.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="h-aside source-list" aria-label="Font sources shown in FontCraft">
          <li>System</li>
          <li>User installed</li>
          <li>FontBase</li>
          <li>Added folders</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>Your text, at your size</h3>
          <p>
            Type your own sample and set it from 6 to 180 px. Every row updates in its own
            typeface, so you compare the letters, not the file names.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sample" data-sample>
          <div class="sample-head">
            <span class="meta">Live sample / 6-180 px</span>
            <span class="sample-font" data-sample-font>Fraunces</span>
          </div>
          <p
            class="sample-text is-fraunces"
            data-sample-text
            lang="en"
            dir="ltr"
            aria-live="polite"
            aria-atomic="true"
          >
            The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
          </p>
          <div class="sample-foot">
            <span class="meta" data-sample-note>Latin / serif</span>
            <button class="sample-next" type="button" data-sample-next hidden>
              Next sample <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>The right script, not a row of boxes</h3>
          <p>
            A font with no Latin letters gets a sample in its own writing system: Arabic, Hebrew,
            Chinese, Japanese, Devanagari, Thai and others.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="h-media">
          <Image
            src={arabicShot}
            alt="FontCraft font list showing Arabic sample text set in several Arabic typefaces."
            widths={[480, 720, 960]}
            sizes="(max-width: 899px) calc(100vw - 90px), 480px"
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption>
            Arabic samples in the list. Fonts without Latin letters are previewed in their own
            script.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </li>

      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>Turn it on, turn it off</h3>
          <p>
            Flip the switch on any row or card and every Windows app sees the font: Word, Photoshop,
            Notepad. Turn on or off everything you are looking at with one button. The file is never
            deleted. FontCraft keeps its Windows settings and puts them back. System fonts stay locked.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="h-media">
          <Image
            src={activationShot}
            alt="FontCraft family panel for a font that is turned off, with a Turn on button and a waterfall preview."
            widths={[480, 720, 960]}
            sizes="(max-width: 899px) calc(100vw - 90px), 480px"
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption>
            A font that is off. The panel offers Turn on; the file stays where it is.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </li>

      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>The whole family, at four sizes</h3>
          <p>
            Click a family to see every style and a waterfall at 72, 48, 24 and 14 px.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="h-aside scale-list" aria-label="Waterfall sizes">
          <li><span class="scale-aa aa-72" aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><span class="meta">72 px</span></li>
          <li><span class="scale-aa aa-48" aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><span class="meta">48 px</span></li>
          <li><span class="scale-aa aa-24" aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><span class="meta">24 px</span></li>
          <li><span class="scale-aa aa-14" aria-hidden="true">Aa</span><span class="meta">14 px</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>A list, or a grid of cards</h3>
          <p>
            Switch between the list and a grid of cards with one click. The list is still the default, and FontCraft remembers your choice.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="h-media">
          <Image
            src={gridShot}
            alt="FontCraft grid view: square cards, each showing a letter in its font, with a switch to turn it on or off."
            widths={[480, 720, 960]}
            sizes="(max-width: 899px) calc(100vw - 90px), 480px"
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption>
            Grid view. Each card has its own on and off switch.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </li>

      <li class="highlight" data-reveal>
        <span class="h-number" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
        <div class="h-body">
          <h3>Collections that follow your text</h3>
          <p>
            Arabic, English, Variable and fonts with more than 3 weights each get a collection, plus a Turned on list of every font that is on. Type Arabic in the preview and only fonts that can show it are listed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="h-media">
          <Image
            src={collectionsShot}
            alt="FontCraft sidebar with Library, Collections and Folders groups, the Arabic collection chosen, and on and off switches on each row."
            widths={[480, 720, 960]}
            sizes="(max-width: 899px) calc(100vw - 90px), 480px"
            format="webp"
            quality={80}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption>
            The Arabic collection, with a bar to turn every font shown on or off.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const sample = document.querySelector('[data-sample]');

  if (sample) {
    const textEl = sample.querySelector('[data-sample-text]');
    const fontEl = sample.querySelector('[data-sample-font]');
    const noteEl = sample.querySelector('[data-sample-note]');
    const nextBtn = sample.querySelector('[data-sample-next]');
    const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');

    const samples = [
      {
        text: 'The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.',
        lang: 'en',
        dir: 'ltr',
        font: 'Fraunces',
        note: 'Latin / serif',
        className: 'is-fraunces',
      },
      {
        text: 'Sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow.',
        lang: 'en',
        dir: 'ltr',
        font: 'Archivo',
        note: 'Latin / grotesk',
        className: 'is-archivo',
      },
      {
        text: 'مرحبا بالعالم',
        lang: 'ar',
        dir: 'rtl',
        font: 'Noto Naskh Arabic',
        note: 'Arabic / naskh',
        className: 'is-arabic',
      },
    ];

    let index = 0;
    let busy = false;

    const apply = (item) => {
      textEl.textContent = item.text;
      textEl.lang = item.lang;
      textEl.dir = item.dir;
      textEl.className = `sample-text ${item.className}`;
      fontEl.textContent = item.font;
      noteEl.textContent = item.note;
    };

    nextBtn.hidden = false;
    nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (busy) return;

      index = (index + 1) % samples.length;
      const item = samples[index];

      if (reduceMotion.matches) {
        apply(item);
        return;
      }

      busy = true;
      textEl.classList.add('is-fading');
      window.setTimeout(() => {
        apply(item);
        textEl.classList.remove('is-fading');
        busy = false;
      }, 150);
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* Hairline grid: cells sit 1px apart on a line-coloured ground */
  .highlights {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .highlight {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .highlight:hover {
    background: var(--bg-raised);
  }

  .highlight:nth-child(2) {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .h-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    right: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .h-body {
    padding-top: 28px;
  }

  .h-body p {
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .h-media {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .h-media :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .h-media figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .h-aside {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .source-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .source-list li {
    padding: 13px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.4vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .source-list li::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    margin-right: 12px;
    background: var(--accent);
    vertical-align: 0.08em;
  }

  .scale-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .scale-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .scale-aa {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 100, 'SOFT' 30, 'WONK' 1;
  }

  .aa-72 {
    font-size: 3.4rem;
  }

  .aa-48 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
  }

  .aa-24 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }

  .aa-14 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .sample {
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 28px);
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .sample-head,
  .sample-foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .sample-head {
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .sample-font {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .sample-text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: clamp(96px, 9vw, 128px);
    padding-block: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.9rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    transition: opacity 150ms ease;
  }

  .sample-text.is-fading {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .sample-text.is-fraunces {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 60, 'SOFT' 30, 'WONK' 1;
  }

  .sample-text.is-archivo {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .sample-text.is-arabic {
    font-family: var(--font-arabic);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .sample-foot {
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .sample-next {
    appearance: none;
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink-faint);
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 140ms ease, color 140ms ease;
  }

  .sample-next:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .highlights {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .highlight:nth-child(2) {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .h-body p {
      max-width: 56ch;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .sample-text {
      min-height: 96px;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .sample-text.is-arabic {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
